  "analysis_md": "设$f(x,y)=x^y,$则$f_x(x,y)=yx^{y-1},\\ f_y(x,y)=x^y\\ln x,\\ f_x(1,3)=3,\\ f_y(1,3)=0,$故\n\n$(1.007)^{2.98}=f(1.007,2.98)$\n\n$=f(1+0.007,3-0.02)$\n\n$\\approx f(1,3)+f_x(1,3)\\times0.007+f_y(1,3)\\times(-0.02)$\n\n$=1+3\\times0.007+0\\cdot(-0.02)$\n\n$=1.021$",
